    stay 90 150
    patience 30
    need Wounds 0.15 50
    need Grime 0.3 40
    need Thirst 0.9 30
    need Hunger 0.5 30
    need Rest 0.6 25
    like map Cheer greater 2 0.003
    map Noise out 0.5
    map Dirt out 0.2
